1
00:00:10,510 --> 00:00:12,846
- Havin' a Broseph? Can I join ya?
- Dad, can you not?

2
00:00:12,929 --> 00:00:13,972
Aww.

3
00:00:14,764 --> 00:00:17,142
Tell me about life in your nomad clan.

4
00:00:17,225 --> 00:00:18,476
My clan, huh?

5
00:00:18,560 --> 00:00:21,312
- We're a small part of Snake Nation.
- Hmm?

6
00:00:21,396 --> 00:00:24,733
Honest folk, most of 'em.
Same was true of my clan.

7
00:00:24,816 --> 00:00:26,818
A few Vipers hated my guts,

8
00:00:26,901 --> 00:00:29,070
but the head of the family
always had my back.

9
00:00:29,654 --> 00:00:32,407
- Did you have friends?
- Lots of 'em, yeah.

10
00:00:32,490 --> 00:00:37,454
Kenzo, José, Renée, Omi, and Marvette.

11
00:00:37,996 --> 00:00:40,457
Oh, and how can I forget Renji?

12
00:00:40,540 --> 00:00:44,044
You remind me of him.
He was about your age.

13
00:00:50,341 --> 00:00:52,010
I still dream of them.

14
00:00:52,093 --> 00:00:53,053
You do?

15
00:00:53,136 --> 00:00:54,846
Every night, when the stars come out,

16
00:00:55,555 --> 00:00:56,473
they find me.

17
00:01:44,187 --> 00:01:46,940
10:15 on a Saturday night

18
00:01:48,399 --> 00:01:52,904
And the tap drips under the striplight

19
00:01:55,365 --> 00:01:57,951
And I'm sitting in the kitchen sink

20
00:02:00,954 --> 00:02:03,456
And the tap drips
Drip, drip, drip, drip

21
00:02:03,540 --> 00:02:05,750
Drip, drip, drip, drip, drip, drip

22
00:02:31,025 --> 00:02:32,360
We got a visitor.

23
00:02:32,443 --> 00:02:33,778
Damn it!

24
00:02:33,862 --> 00:02:35,196
Well? Who is he?

25
00:02:35,280 --> 00:02:37,073
- Fuck if I know.
- Do you?

26
00:02:37,157 --> 00:02:38,908
- Hm?
- Don't look at me.

27
00:02:38,992 --> 00:02:40,118
Yo, rust bucket.

28
00:02:40,201 --> 00:02:42,078
- Oh!
- Fuck you doin' on our turf?

29
00:02:42,162 --> 00:02:43,830
- Got a tongue, so wag it.
- Huh?

30
00:02:43,913 --> 00:02:46,291
Hey, Talia, you know this choom?

31
00:02:46,374 --> 00:02:48,835
- You deaf, old-timer?
- Huh.

32
00:02:48,918 --> 00:02:51,504
Promised us no more interruptions.

33
00:02:51,588 --> 00:02:53,464
Or did I mis-fuckin'-hear?

34
00:02:53,548 --> 00:02:55,466
He's no one I know.

35
00:02:55,550 --> 00:02:56,467
Talia!

36
00:02:56,551 --> 00:02:59,095
That's enough outta you.

37
00:03:00,555 --> 00:03:02,515
You done?

38
00:03:02,599 --> 00:03:04,601
Shit.

39
00:03:08,062 --> 00:03:09,480
No.

40
00:03:09,564 --> 00:03:10,982
Not done yet.

41
00:03:11,065 --> 00:03:13,985
Runnin' on bargain-bin chrome.

42
00:03:14,068 --> 00:03:16,404
What do you think
you're gonna pull here, huh?

43
00:03:16,487 --> 00:03:17,864
Tough old bastard, give ya that--

44
00:03:17,947 --> 00:03:19,616
Fuck! Look out!

45
00:03:21,784 --> 00:03:23,244
Oops.

46
00:03:23,786 --> 00:03:26,664
Oops is right, you yappy sack of shit!

47
00:03:30,501 --> 00:03:32,337
- Scan him.
- On it.

48
00:03:32,420 --> 00:03:35,006
Ran your damn mouth again. Got distracted.

49
00:03:35,089 --> 00:03:36,758
Well, the gonk's, like, super weak.

50
00:03:36,841 --> 00:03:39,177
Which don't matter if he's packin' iron!

51
00:03:39,260 --> 00:03:41,179
Damn it. T-Talia.

52
00:03:41,262 --> 00:03:42,472
And you!

53
00:03:42,555 --> 00:03:46,643
What's a guy with paperclips for arms
doin' with a hand cannon like that?

54
00:03:46,726 --> 00:03:49,437
Talia! Wanna tell us why this bum's here?

55
00:03:49,520 --> 00:03:50,688
Huh?

56
00:03:52,440 --> 00:03:53,316
Yo, yo!

57
00:03:53,399 --> 00:03:55,944
- Choom reads like a cyberpsycho burnout.
- What?

58
00:03:56,027 --> 00:03:57,779
- You're shittin' me.
- Huh?

59
00:03:57,862 --> 00:04:00,823
You used to be
an edgerunner, old man?

60
00:04:00,907 --> 00:04:02,325
Well, shit.

61
00:04:02,408 --> 00:04:04,410
Grab him. Pin him down!

62
00:04:04,494 --> 00:04:08,081
Hey! What the hell? Get your hands off me!

63
00:04:08,164 --> 00:04:10,583
Relax. Routine maintenance.

64
00:04:11,167 --> 00:04:14,587
We'll give ya a jump-start. Bring
that old chrome of yours back to life.

65
00:04:15,171 --> 00:04:18,341
To witness the moment
a cyberpsycho is born...

66
00:04:18,424 --> 00:04:20,927
Ain't nothin' in this world
more beautiful!

67
00:04:24,847 --> 00:04:27,100
Hey, what about me?

68
00:04:27,600 --> 00:04:30,395
Yeah, what about you? Yo, hold him down!

69
00:04:30,478 --> 00:04:32,438
Today's my day on the table.

70
00:04:32,522 --> 00:04:33,731
You said so.

71
00:04:34,232 --> 00:04:35,441
Hey!

72
00:04:39,153 --> 00:04:41,572
- Entitled little bitch.
- Huh?

73
00:04:41,656 --> 00:04:43,408
I said we're tired of your shit!

74
00:04:43,491 --> 00:04:45,702
Today, it's this fucking clown!

75
00:04:45,785 --> 00:04:50,164
And before that, a whole goddamn corp army
kicked down our door 'cause of you!

76
00:04:50,748 --> 00:04:52,292
And you ran away.

77
00:04:53,084 --> 00:04:56,087
- What?
- Ran from Kang Tao like cowards!

78
00:04:56,170 --> 00:04:57,797
The fuck did you just say?

79
00:04:57,880 --> 00:05:00,300
But not me!

80
00:05:02,885 --> 00:05:07,807
I ain't takin' no more shit
from a trust-fund brat!

81
00:05:14,105 --> 00:05:16,024
Just blast her already!

82
00:05:16,107 --> 00:05:18,484
Shut up. Don't got a clear shot.

83
00:05:18,568 --> 00:05:20,945
Yo, what do you want me
to do with this guy?

84
00:05:28,578 --> 00:05:29,787
Yaah!

85
00:05:34,459 --> 00:05:37,545
Now die, poser bitch!

86
00:05:40,298 --> 00:05:41,799
Don't move!

87
00:05:42,300 --> 00:05:44,135
See? Aim's still sharp.

88
00:05:44,218 --> 00:05:45,845
Willin' to risk it?

89
00:05:45,928 --> 00:05:49,474
You wanna live?
Then step away from the girl!

90
00:05:51,726 --> 00:05:52,977
Now!

91
00:05:56,564 --> 00:05:59,317
Talia, knock it off! They're leavin'!

92
00:05:59,400 --> 00:06:00,943
She's fuckin' whacked!

93
00:06:02,528 --> 00:06:04,364
You're a whacking bunch of traitors!

94
00:06:04,447 --> 00:06:06,824
- Calm down.
- You're safe now.

95
00:06:06,908 --> 00:06:08,076
Talia!

96
00:06:09,702 --> 00:06:14,082
Safe? That's what you think?
That you saved me?

97
00:06:14,165 --> 00:06:15,875
This was your fault!

98
00:06:15,958 --> 00:06:17,627
Doesn't matter now.

99
00:06:17,710 --> 00:06:19,879
It's over. Stand down.

100
00:06:19,962 --> 00:06:21,923
Taking you back to your mom.

101
00:06:22,006 --> 00:06:25,676
What the fuck?

102
00:06:25,760 --> 00:06:27,136
Talia?

103
00:06:30,556 --> 00:06:34,143
It's... it's always the same
with you people.

104
00:06:34,227 --> 00:06:38,356
Is taking everything from me
so fucking fun for you?

105
00:06:38,439 --> 00:06:41,526
I have nothing left. Nothing!

106
00:06:41,609 --> 00:06:44,737
- Hey, you all right?
- Don't touch me!

107
00:06:49,283 --> 00:06:50,535
Talia? Talia!

108
00:06:54,831 --> 00:06:55,790
The chip?

109
00:06:56,290 --> 00:06:57,834
Lost, I'm afraid.

110
00:06:58,751 --> 00:07:01,546
My rivals are pressing me
for accountability.

111
00:07:01,629 --> 00:07:04,215
In acquiring the chip,
we would have silenced them.

112
00:07:04,298 --> 00:07:05,550
Now, they'll grow louder.

113
00:07:06,134 --> 00:07:07,343
Bolder.

114
00:07:07,427 --> 00:07:10,263
In hindsight, we should have
arranged for a backup plan.

115
00:07:10,346 --> 00:07:12,432
I didn't expect our outsource would fail.

116
00:07:12,515 --> 00:07:14,225
We gave them good intel.

117
00:07:15,059 --> 00:07:17,603
That was the risk of hiring mercenaries.

118
00:07:18,312 --> 00:07:21,023
All because I took my wife's advice.

119
00:07:21,107 --> 00:07:22,567
Funny, isn't it?

120
00:07:23,651 --> 00:07:24,986
No, sir.

121
00:07:25,069 --> 00:07:27,280
It's all right. You're free to laugh.

122
00:07:27,780 --> 00:07:30,992
It seems the crew's leader
is an old flame of hers.

123
00:07:31,784 --> 00:07:34,328
I hear he was discharged
from the hospital.

124
00:07:35,121 --> 00:07:38,833
More importantly, the chip.
What have you learned?

125
00:07:38,916 --> 00:07:43,087
We don't believe that MaxTac has it.
Or the NCPD broadly.

126
00:07:43,171 --> 00:07:46,340
Likewise, there's no indication
of internal misappropriation.

127
00:07:46,424 --> 00:07:49,135
And we've confirmed
Arasaka didn't recover it?

128
00:07:49,218 --> 00:07:50,595
That's correct.

129
00:07:50,678 --> 00:07:54,432
The most plausible scenario is
acquisition by an unknown third party.

130
00:07:55,475 --> 00:07:58,853
Meaning they would've arrived
prior to the police.

131
00:08:03,941 --> 00:08:05,735
An extraction like that requires

132
00:08:05,818 --> 00:08:08,446
the precision and timing
of a professional.

133
00:08:08,946 --> 00:08:10,323
Question's who.

134
00:08:11,324 --> 00:08:12,575
They all look the same!

135
00:08:12,658 --> 00:08:15,369
- Someone's coming. Kyoko...
- Chill, Miggy. Finish my...

136
00:08:15,453 --> 00:08:18,122
They're taking me! Someone's--

137
00:08:18,206 --> 00:08:19,123
Kyoko!

138
00:08:21,167 --> 00:08:22,251
Capri?

139
00:08:25,338 --> 00:08:27,256
Weird dream.

140
00:08:27,924 --> 00:08:29,634
Huh. Huh?

141
00:08:30,134 --> 00:08:31,761
Why is surveillance offline?

142
00:08:33,846 --> 00:08:35,014
The fuck?

143
00:08:35,890 --> 00:08:38,518
Huh? That case, is that Capri?

144
00:08:38,601 --> 00:08:42,230
Dickheads! I told 'em to push
the goddamn security update.

145
00:08:43,272 --> 00:08:44,857
- Got ya!
- Our ride?

146
00:08:44,941 --> 00:08:47,401
- Front porch.
- Stupid security!

147
00:08:47,485 --> 00:08:48,945
- Idiots! Idiots!
- Wheelman?

148
00:08:49,028 --> 00:08:51,906
Sorry, some items may be sold separately.

149
00:08:51,989 --> 00:08:53,115
Right. Hold on.

150
00:08:53,199 --> 00:08:55,493
- Suck it!
- Shit! Fall ba--

151
00:08:55,576 --> 00:08:57,411
King! Run a scan!

152
00:08:57,495 --> 00:08:59,038
Miguel!

153
00:09:09,298 --> 00:09:12,009
Shit! Shit! They're getting away!

154
00:09:13,052 --> 00:09:15,513
Die, jizzbags! Die!

155
00:09:17,056 --> 00:09:19,725
Jackpot! Never a chance!

156
00:09:19,809 --> 00:09:21,477
Aah!

157
00:09:22,270 --> 00:09:25,022
- Miguel, the case.
- Leave the fucking thing.

158
00:09:25,106 --> 00:09:26,232
We need to bail.

159
00:09:30,319 --> 00:09:32,655
Hey, snap out of it! You from the lab?

160
00:09:32,738 --> 00:09:34,407
Call MaxTac!

161
00:09:34,490 --> 00:09:36,242
- Confirmed cyberpsycho!
- Get back!

162
00:09:44,625 --> 00:09:47,420
I did it! I got you out. Capri!

163
00:09:47,503 --> 00:09:49,088
I'm here!

164
00:09:49,547 --> 00:09:51,591
You're free of Arasaka's shackles.

165
00:09:51,674 --> 00:09:53,467
Free to exist.

166
00:09:53,551 --> 00:09:55,052
And you're all mine!

167
00:09:55,136 --> 00:09:57,388
You're always and forever mine!

168
00:10:05,771 --> 00:10:08,274
Fuck you! Rotten shits!

169
00:10:08,357 --> 00:10:10,401
Calling Capri worthless? Then die!

170
00:10:10,484 --> 00:10:12,903
She'll grind your motherfucking tongues!

171
00:10:12,987 --> 00:10:15,031
Serves you right! She belongs to me!

172
00:10:15,114 --> 00:10:16,532
Capri is mine!

173
00:10:16,616 --> 00:10:18,784
Mine! Mine!

174
00:10:18,868 --> 00:10:21,829
Oh, good, good, good. You came back.

175
00:10:21,912 --> 00:10:23,789
Your little shadow, too.

176
00:10:24,624 --> 00:10:26,542
Are you our lucky ticket?

177
00:10:26,626 --> 00:10:29,045
I have high hopes for you, boy.

178
00:10:30,588 --> 00:10:32,131
So, how we gettin' in?

179
00:10:33,007 --> 00:10:33,966
Hmm?

180
00:10:34,050 --> 00:10:35,217
D?

181
00:10:35,926 --> 00:10:37,553
Going through the same door.

182
00:10:37,637 --> 00:10:39,305
Got a score to settle.

183
00:11:14,423 --> 00:11:16,342
This was your brilliant plan?

184
00:11:16,425 --> 00:11:20,096
Running us in circles, round
and around and around this dump?

185
00:11:21,514 --> 00:11:23,224
I'm gonna die in here,

186
00:11:23,307 --> 00:11:25,768
thanks to you and your stupid
revenge trip, you moron!

187
00:11:30,022 --> 00:11:31,232
Huh?

188
00:11:31,315 --> 00:11:33,651
Wait! Don't leave me behind!

189
00:11:33,734 --> 00:11:35,486
Suddenly, he knows where to go?

190
00:11:36,070 --> 00:11:37,530
How?

191
00:11:42,201 --> 00:11:43,619
D, wait!

192
00:11:55,256 --> 00:11:56,257
Huh?

193
00:11:57,508 --> 00:11:59,927
- What is that?
- Rot.

194
00:12:00,010 --> 00:12:01,262
You mean...

195
00:12:01,846 --> 00:12:03,848
The smell of meat gone bad.

196
00:12:05,599 --> 00:12:07,518
Uh...

197
00:12:09,603 --> 00:12:12,690
What? You've never seen a corpse?

198
00:12:13,357 --> 00:12:14,608
Not this many.

199
00:12:19,363 --> 00:12:21,282
He doesn't look dead.

200
00:12:21,365 --> 00:12:23,284
Still hangin' on, this one.

201
00:12:25,453 --> 00:12:26,537
Hmm?

202
00:12:26,620 --> 00:12:29,123
Is that a chip?

203
00:12:35,671 --> 00:12:36,839
Found you.

204
00:12:37,673 --> 00:12:38,549
Huh?

205
00:12:39,133 --> 00:12:40,050
Wha...

206
00:13:07,077 --> 00:13:08,329
Huh?

207
00:13:18,172 --> 00:13:19,882
Uh... D?

208
00:13:22,635 --> 00:13:24,053
Is that a kid?

209
00:13:26,055 --> 00:13:27,973
Success!

210
00:13:31,018 --> 00:13:33,479
He's alive! He's alive! He lives!

211
00:13:34,563 --> 00:13:35,898
Uh... Huh?

212
00:13:46,659 --> 00:13:47,660
D?

213
00:13:51,080 --> 00:13:53,499
No! Why'd the door unlock?

214
00:13:54,583 --> 00:13:57,002
Hey, wait! Where you goin'?

215
00:13:57,586 --> 00:13:58,420
Fuck!

216
00:13:58,504 --> 00:14:01,423
Fuck, fuck, fuck, fuck, fuck, fuck, fuck!

217
00:14:01,507 --> 00:14:05,177
Capri! Stop! Don't run from me too!

218
00:14:05,261 --> 00:14:07,054
You're not going anywhere!

219
00:14:10,349 --> 00:14:11,892
Whew. There you are!

220
00:14:11,976 --> 00:14:13,227
Wait for me.

221
00:14:16,564 --> 00:14:18,274
- So clingy.
- D?

222
00:14:18,357 --> 00:14:19,608
Wait!

223
00:14:38,836 --> 00:14:40,546
- Hey.
- Huh?

224
00:14:40,629 --> 00:14:42,548
Give me back my damn body.

225
00:14:43,215 --> 00:14:44,675
Wow.

226
00:14:44,758 --> 00:14:45,593
Go away.

227
00:14:47,678 --> 00:14:49,471
I'm surprised to see you still here.

228
00:14:49,555 --> 00:14:50,973
It's my body!

229
00:14:55,644 --> 00:14:57,229
Huh?

230
00:14:59,315 --> 00:15:00,983
C'mere! [grunts[

231
00:15:01,984 --> 00:15:03,736
Bye-bye, choomba!

232
00:15:09,491 --> 00:15:10,910
D?

233
00:15:12,328 --> 00:15:15,372
Whoa! This takes me back!

234
00:15:23,213 --> 00:15:24,924
Yuck!

235
00:15:25,007 --> 00:15:26,884
Stop doin' weird shit with my body!

236
00:15:26,967 --> 00:15:29,386
Oh, wow! It's you again, huh?

237
00:15:29,470 --> 00:15:31,096
You're strange and feisty!

238
00:15:31,180 --> 00:15:33,265
You shoulda already
fizzled and popped by now.

239
00:15:33,349 --> 00:15:35,392
Who's callin' who strange?

240
00:15:35,476 --> 00:15:37,895
Oh, wait! What are you doin'?
What are you doin'?

241
00:15:37,978 --> 00:15:40,397
Wait... Whoa! Wait!

242
00:15:40,481 --> 00:15:43,359
Whoa! No, no, no, no, no, no, no!

243
00:15:44,985 --> 00:15:46,570
What? No way!

244
00:15:46,654 --> 00:15:50,282
Wh... what did you do to me?
This is amazing!

245
00:15:50,366 --> 00:15:53,285
You full of any more fun surprises?

246
00:15:56,789 --> 00:15:57,915
Hey-oh!

247
00:16:06,131 --> 00:16:08,133
Whoa...

248
00:16:10,594 --> 00:16:11,929
Did you do that?

249
00:16:12,012 --> 00:16:14,264
Sure did! And now it's your turn.

250
00:16:14,348 --> 00:16:15,808
Huh?

251
00:16:18,143 --> 00:16:19,979
Oh shit! Gah!

252
00:16:21,772 --> 00:16:24,066
Whoa! Whoa...

253
00:16:26,443 --> 00:16:28,821
Dumbass! Why don't ya watch the damn road?

254
00:16:28,904 --> 00:16:30,030
You're blamin' me?

255
00:16:30,114 --> 00:16:33,617
You didn't see that big red flash?
The steering wheel short-circed!

256
00:16:33,701 --> 00:16:36,787
It was that guy!
That spiky-haired dickwad hacked my ride!

257
00:16:36,870 --> 00:16:38,831
It never is your fault, is it?

258
00:16:38,914 --> 00:16:40,666
Woman, are you blind?

259
00:16:40,749 --> 00:16:42,251
- Not like you!
- Are too!

260
00:16:42,334 --> 00:16:43,919
- A little help?
- Are too!

261
00:16:44,003 --> 00:16:46,380
- My seatbelt's jammed! Hello?
- Fuck you!

262
00:16:46,463 --> 00:16:48,007
- Oh, shut up!
- Somebody--

263
00:16:48,090 --> 00:16:50,134
Why are you so fuckin' trigger happy?

264
00:16:50,217 --> 00:16:52,386
I'm gonna get that spiky-haired freak!

265
00:16:52,469 --> 00:16:55,889
I knew you could do it!

266
00:16:55,973 --> 00:16:57,433
